WEBVTT

00:05.076 --> 00:07.476
&lt;i>You don't have to be
a prisoner of depression.&lt;/i>

00:07.645 --> 00:09.738
&lt;i>Unlock the door
of darkness and despair...&lt;/i>

00:09.948 --> 00:12.542
&lt;i>... and step into the sunlight
with Lumitrol.&lt;/i>

00:12.717 --> 00:15.845
&lt;i>If you're taking an MAO inhibitor,
consult your physician.&lt;/i>

00:16.354 --> 00:17.446
&lt;i>- Tremors, nausea...&lt;/i>

00:17.622 --> 00:19.089
You should try that stuff.

00:19.257 --> 00:21.191
What for? I'm not depressed.

00:21.359 --> 00:25.728
- Really? Why not?
- What have I got to be depressed about?

00:25.897 --> 00:28.593
You've been divorced twice,
you live on your brother's couch...

00:28.767 --> 00:31.361
...and your only child
is flunking tenth grade.

00:32.504 --> 00:35.029
You're flunking tenth grade?
When did this happen?

00:35.206 --> 00:37.936
Easy, dude. I think you got
bigger things to worry about.

00:39.978 --> 00:41.912
Charlie, you're being an ass about this.

00:42.080 --> 00:43.672
I said no. End of discussion.

00:43.848 --> 00:45.645
Yeah, that'll do it.

00:45.817 --> 00:49.446
It's a couple dance lessons so we
don't look like idiots at our wedding.

00:49.621 --> 00:52.954
I've said yes to everything
having to do with this stupid wedding...

00:53.124 --> 00:54.318
...but this is too much.

00:54.492 --> 00:58.087
- You think our wedding is stupid?
- Lf I have to dance it is.

00:58.263 --> 01:00.595
You know what, just drop dead.

01:00.765 --> 01:04.701
Fine, I'll drop dead
and you can dance on my grave.

01:19.384 --> 01:23.377
You do know you're going to be taking
dancing lessons?

01:23.555 --> 01:25.420
Oh, yeah.

01:25.590 --> 01:27.353
Does that depress you?

01:27.525 --> 01:31.518
- A little.
- May I suggest you try Lumitrol.

01:33.164 --> 01:35.724
- What?
- Unless you're taking an MAO inhibitor.

01:35.900 --> 01:38.596
In which case, consult your physician.

01:38.770 --> 01:42.501
Hard to believe
he's flunking tenth grade.

02:14.439 --> 02:16.202
- Hey.
- Hey.

02:16.374 --> 02:18.535
Did you cave on the dancing?

02:19.043 --> 02:21.204
- Yeah.
- You have to grovel?

02:22.447 --> 02:25.211
Like a leper at a kissing booth.

02:25.650 --> 02:27.242
Did you at least get make-up sex?

02:27.418 --> 02:30.717
- Nope.
- Wow, it's like you're already married.

02:31.623 --> 02:33.648
I might as well give her my testicles...

02:33.825 --> 02:36.191
...and use the empty sack
as a man purse.

02:36.361 --> 02:40.923
Hey, hey, don't knock the man purse.
Terrific way to carry your keys...

02:41.099 --> 02:44.535
...ChapStick, sunblock, moist wipes.

02:45.136 --> 02:46.603
Please move out of my house.

02:47.038 --> 02:52.101
Hey, face it, big brother, we're a team.
Like Ernest and Julio Gallo.

02:53.077 --> 02:56.979
Seriously, get some cardboard boxes,
fill them with your crap and go.

02:57.148 --> 03:00.140
See, that's just misdirected anger.
You're not mad at me...

03:00.318 --> 03:03.651
...you're mad at yourself for trading
your dignity and self-respect...

03:03.821 --> 03:06.051
...for security,
peace of mind and regular sex.

03:06.224 --> 03:07.657
Where do you get that?

03:07.825 --> 03:09.417
I've been married twice, Julio.

03:11.663 --> 03:14.791
The key is to make the best of it.
Like the dance lessons.

03:14.966 --> 03:18.527
They can be fun.
You and Chelsea practicing...

03:18.736 --> 03:22.433
...learning to glide across
the dance floor as a single organism...

03:22.607 --> 03:25.405
...embracing the music
like the breath of life itself.

03:26.311 --> 03:30.247
Okay, first decorate my house
then move out.

03:30.415 --> 03:32.383
Cute.
You'll see on your wedding day...

03:32.550 --> 03:35.644
...when you step out onto
the dance floor with your new bride...

03:35.820 --> 03:38.618
...and sweep her into your arms
with everybody watching.

03:39.190 --> 03:42.682
- Sorry, I can't see it.
- Let me help you.

03:42.860 --> 03:46.057
&lt;i>Precious and few
Are the moments&lt;/i>

03:46.231 --> 03:52.431
&lt;i>We two can share&lt;/i>

03:53.504 --> 03:55.802
How'd you know
that's the song she wants?

03:55.974 --> 03:58.670
Who do you think suggested it to her?

03:58.843 --> 04:02.472
Okay. Let's see what you got.

04:03.181 --> 04:04.978
- What?
- Dance with me. Come on.

04:05.650 --> 04:07.550
Are you out of your mind?

04:07.719 --> 04:11.450
- I'm just gonna give you a few tips.
- Keep your tip away from me.

04:11.623 --> 04:13.250
You can embarrass yourself now...

04:13.424 --> 04:15.915
...or embarrass yourself
at your first dance class...

04:16.094 --> 04:18.426
...in front of Chelsea
and a bunch of strangers.

04:22.834 --> 04:26.099
Okay, I just want you to know
I'm only letting you touch me...

04:26.304 --> 04:28.602
...because I'm half in the bag.

04:28.806 --> 04:31.741
Boy, if I had a nickel
for every time I heard that.

04:32.844 --> 04:35.779
Now, put your right hand
on my lower back.

04:35.947 --> 04:38.973
- And your left hand holds my right hand.
- Okay.

04:39.150 --> 04:42.278
Whoa, whoa. We're not cracking walnuts.

04:42.453 --> 04:44.921
Firmly but gently,
like you hold a baby bird.

04:45.089 --> 04:46.488
I've never held a baby bird.

04:46.658 --> 04:48.023
Okay, like you hold a boob.

04:48.593 --> 04:51.357
- I am holding a boob.
- Ha, ha.

04:51.529 --> 04:54.521
We start with a simple waltz.
You're the boy, I'm the girl.

04:54.699 --> 04:56.894
That's how it'd break down in prison.

04:57.068 --> 05:00.037
I don't know, Charlie,
you've always been the pretty one.

05:00.204 --> 05:04.300
And one, two, three,
two, two, three...

05:04.475 --> 05:06.966
...one, two, three, two, two, three.

05:07.145 --> 05:09.204
Okay, you have to back off a half step.

05:09.380 --> 05:12.213
There's no groin contact
in ballroom dancing.

05:13.451 --> 05:16.352
I wonder if that's why
they call it "ball room."

05:18.990 --> 05:22.289
Man, your grandmother really did
a number on those poor bastards.

05:25.163 --> 05:27.927
It's a miracle I turned out
as well as I did.

05:48.586 --> 05:51.111
Hey, Uncle Charlie,
wanna dance with me?

05:51.289 --> 05:54.019
Hey, Jake,
wanna live in a foster home?

05:54.192 --> 05:56.126
Sometimes.

05:56.294 --> 05:59.161
Don't sass me, boy.
I'll take the switch to you.

06:01.532 --> 06:02.999
Hello, man of my dreams.

06:03.167 --> 06:04.964
Hello, love of my life.

06:05.136 --> 06:06.831
Hello, reason I go to therapy.

06:07.004 --> 06:09.564
You go to therapy
because you're weak.

06:09.741 --> 06:12.232
I'm weak because you broke my spirit
at age 5.

06:12.410 --> 06:14.139
Oh, boo-hoo for you.

06:14.312 --> 06:16.507
Guys, guys,
can we please not do this?

06:16.681 --> 06:19.172
- What?
- Just saying hello.

06:20.518 --> 06:23.146
I'm gonna go put this stuff away.
Thanks for the scarf.

06:23.588 --> 06:26.648
My pleasure, dear.
It looks beautiful on you.

06:26.824 --> 06:28.655
Thank you.

06:28.826 --> 06:31.659
- That woman is just a treasure.
- I know.

06:31.829 --> 06:33.820
- Worth her weight in gold.
- Yes, she is.

06:33.998 --> 06:37.229
Speaking of which, have you
talked to her about a prenup?

06:37.435 --> 06:39.926
What? No, I'm not gonna ask her
for a prenup.

06:40.104 --> 06:43.870
Charles, 50 percent of all marriages
end in divorce.

06:44.041 --> 06:47.943
And guess which half the guys
who can't keep it in their pants fall into?

06:48.112 --> 06:50.672
Hey, I have never once cheated
on Chelsea.

06:50.848 --> 06:53.681
- How long have you known her?
- About a year and a half.

06:53.851 --> 06:56.183
How long do you plan on
being married?

06:57.755 --> 07:00.383
Criminy, I need a prenup.

07:04.796 --> 07:07.765
And one, two, three, one, two, three.

07:07.965 --> 07:11.423
Very nice, two, three.

07:11.602 --> 07:14.537
You're doing great, sweetie.
Have you been practicing?

07:14.705 --> 07:18.698
No, no. No. I'm a musician.
It's instinctive.

07:19.844 --> 07:22.438
So the pictures Jake e-mailed me
of you and Alan...

07:22.613 --> 07:26.174
...was just what,
a tender moment between brothers?

07:28.352 --> 07:32.015
How old do kids have to be
before it's legal to punch them?

07:32.190 --> 07:35.057
Oh, come on, you'd never hit Jake.

07:35.226 --> 07:38.889
That's exactly what I want you to tell
Child Services.

07:39.397 --> 07:42.230
I think it's great you cared
enough about this to practice.

07:42.400 --> 07:44.163
So I get some points in the bank?

07:44.335 --> 07:47.065
- Whole bunch.
- Good, good.

07:47.238 --> 07:50.264
Hey, speaking of banks...

07:50.441 --> 07:53.205
...l've been thinking.
Now don't overreact...

07:53.377 --> 07:58.610
...but maybe we should talk about
the possibility of getting some kind of a...

07:58.783 --> 08:00.774
What do you call them? ...prenup.

08:02.386 --> 08:04.581
Sure. Want your lawyer
to draw it up or mine?

08:04.755 --> 08:08.282
Now switch partners
with the couple to your left.

08:11.796 --> 08:14.856
- Hello.
- Hi.

08:15.032 --> 08:17.466
- Are you two getting married?
- Yeah.

08:17.635 --> 08:22.800
That's wonderful. It took me 38 years
to get my husband to dance with me.

08:23.274 --> 08:24.764
Well, better late than never.

08:24.942 --> 08:28.207
He's doing it now because I caught
him banging our church organist.

08:31.449 --> 08:33.644
Oh.

08:33.818 --> 08:37.720
Wanna help a nice lady
give a little payback?

08:38.789 --> 08:39.949
Switch!

08:42.460 --> 08:43.620
Hi. Missed you.

08:43.794 --> 08:45.284
Me too.

08:45.463 --> 08:48.455
So you were saying you're okay
with the prenup thing?

08:48.633 --> 08:51.295
Yeah. I was trying to figure
out a way to bring it up.

08:51.469 --> 08:53.596
Really? Why were you
gonna bring it up?

08:53.771 --> 08:57.639
Well, I just think it's smart for both
of us to protect our property.

08:57.808 --> 08:59.571
What property do you have?

09:00.311 --> 09:02.438
Not a lot. Just a little real estate.

09:03.214 --> 09:04.442
Real estate?

09:04.615 --> 09:07.140
No big deal.
Just a few apartment buildings.

09:07.318 --> 09:09.616
- Buildings?
And switch.

09:10.488 --> 09:12.820
Keep walking, pal.

09:12.990 --> 09:15.754
When were you planning on telling me
you own buildings?

09:16.360 --> 09:18.191
I didn't think it was that important.

09:18.362 --> 09:20.592
It's important enough for you
to want a prenup.

09:20.765 --> 09:24.292
- You're the one who brought it up.
- But I'm not hiding anything from you.

09:24.468 --> 09:27.335
You know everything I've got.
A house on the beach...

09:27.505 --> 09:31.532
...a car in the garage and
a worthless douche in my guest room.

09:32.743 --> 09:35.007
What about all the royalties
from your music?

09:35.179 --> 09:38.171
Yeah, well, you've got buildings.

09:39.183 --> 09:40.343
Just three.

09:41.018 --> 09:43.885
- Just three?
- Why are you getting so upset?

09:44.055 --> 09:49.186
I thought I knew you. I had no idea
you had some secret life as a slumlord.

09:49.627 --> 09:50.685
I'm not a slumlord.

09:50.861 --> 09:53.227
Two are in the marina
and one's in Brentwood.

09:53.664 --> 09:56.633
- Oh, my God, that's even worse.
- Why?

09:56.801 --> 09:58.564
We've been together
almost two years.

09:58.736 --> 10:02.399
Would it have killed you to pick up
a check once in a while?

10:02.573 --> 10:04.370
Switch.

10:05.810 --> 10:07.300
Hello again.

10:15.286 --> 10:18.722
&lt;i>Ladies and gentlemen,
please welcome for the first time...&lt;/i>

10:18.889 --> 10:23.258
&lt;i>... as husband and wife
Mr. And Mrs. Alan Harper.&lt;/i>

10:26.030 --> 10:30.160
&lt;i>Now I've had the time of my life&lt;/i>

10:30.334 --> 10:34.395
&lt;i>No, I never felt like this before&lt;/i>

10:34.572 --> 10:38.668
&lt;i>Yes, I swear
It's the truth&lt;/i>

10:38.843 --> 10:41.744
&lt;i>And I owe it all to you&lt;/i>

10:41.912 --> 10:47.748
&lt;i>Cos I had the time of my life&lt;/i>

10:47.918 --> 10:50.887
&lt;i>And I owe it all to you&lt;/i>

10:56.160 --> 10:58.526
Hey, how was dance lessons?

10:58.896 --> 11:00.796
You wanna know
how dance lessons were?

11:00.965 --> 11:04.731
I'll tell you how dance lessons were.
Chelsea wants a freaking prenup.

11:04.902 --> 11:07.803
Just because you dance
like a middle-aged white guy?

11:07.972 --> 11:10.133
- I am not middle-aged.
- Oh, sorry.

11:10.308 --> 11:11.775
You. You're middle-aged.

11:12.410 --> 11:13.775
I'm younger than you.

11:13.944 --> 11:17.971
You're also broke, losing your hair
and sleeping on my hide-a-bed.

11:18.149 --> 11:21.516
Always gotta bring a gun
to a knife fight, don't you?

11:23.387 --> 11:26.049
- What the hell are you watching?
- It's my wedding video.

11:26.223 --> 11:27.884
No kidding. Where am I?

11:28.059 --> 11:30.550
In the coatroom
banging Judith's sister.

11:30.728 --> 11:34.664
Oh, right. Wish you had that video.

11:35.666 --> 11:37.429
So why does Chelsea want a prenup?

11:37.601 --> 11:41.594
She's got three apartment buildings
she doesn't want me to get my hands on.

11:41.772 --> 11:44.002
Really?
Anything I could live in for free?

11:44.175 --> 11:47.576
You know, house-sit,
building manager in lieu of rent.

11:48.379 --> 11:51.177
- How did this become about you?
- Fine, I'll stay here.

11:51.349 --> 11:53.715
Oh, good, I was worried.

11:54.285 --> 11:57.277
The point is, Chelsea's been keeping
a secret from me.

11:57.455 --> 12:01.152
Maybe she wants to make sure you loved
her for herself and not her property.

12:01.325 --> 12:03.316
Oh, so I don't even get the choice?

12:03.861 --> 12:05.453
I would think you would be happy.

12:05.663 --> 12:08.097
She's well-off
and doesn't care about your money.

12:08.265 --> 12:11.132
- Which makes me trust her even less.
- What?

12:11.302 --> 12:12.633
Alan, think it through.

12:12.803 --> 12:16.432
If she's not interested in my money,
then why is she marrying me?

12:18.309 --> 12:20.277
I have no idea.

12:21.679 --> 12:27.049
Exactly. We may have to consider
the possibility that Chelsea's insane.

12:27.785 --> 12:29.776
I see your point.

12:33.724 --> 12:35.555
She look like she's sorry?

12:37.995 --> 12:40.896
Yeah. Sorry she ever met you.

12:41.599 --> 12:44.033
- Hey, Chels.
- Hello, Alan.

12:44.201 --> 12:48.001
Brr. I think my nipples just got hard.

12:48.973 --> 12:50.338
Yeah, well, too bad.

12:50.508 --> 12:53.443
She deceived me and doesn't trust
our marriage is gonna last.

12:53.611 --> 12:55.579
Aren't you the one
who wanted the prenup?

12:55.746 --> 12:56.838
- That's different.
- How?

12:57.014 --> 13:00.245
Because when I brought it up
I thought I had more stuff than her.

13:00.418 --> 13:01.942
Okay, let me get this straight.

13:02.119 --> 13:05.646
You're upset because you're marrying
a woman whose only character flaw...

13:05.823 --> 13:08.451
...is that she happens
to have her own money?

13:08.626 --> 13:10.787
I knew you wouldn't understand.

13:16.300 --> 13:18.427
&lt;i>So we take each other's hands&lt;/i>

13:18.602 --> 13:24.097
&lt;i>Cos we seem to understand the urgency&lt;/i>

13:24.275 --> 13:26.505
&lt;i>Just remember&lt;/i>

13:26.677 --> 13:29.612
&lt;i>You're the one thing&lt;/i>

13:29.780 --> 13:32.840
&lt;i>I can't get enough of&lt;/i>

13:33.017 --> 13:36.248
That's the last time
she ever moved her pelvis like that.

13:50.167 --> 13:53.227
Are we gonna talk or are you
gonna sit there pretending to read?

13:53.404 --> 13:55.167
I'm not pretending.

13:55.339 --> 13:58.604
If I didn't know how to read,
I would've told you a long time ago.

13:59.777 --> 14:01.836
I wouldn't have deceived you.

14:02.012 --> 14:03.274
Don't be such a child.

14:03.814 --> 14:06.612
I'm the child? You're the one
who's been keeping secrets.

14:06.784 --> 14:10.720
It wasn't really a secret.
I would've told you if you'd asked.

14:12.389 --> 14:16.792
Oh, really? So it's my fault
that I didn't ask if you're a land baron?

14:18.028 --> 14:19.620
What else should I be asking you?

14:19.797 --> 14:23.426
Were you born with a penis?
Is this your home planet?

14:24.101 --> 14:26.035
- Okay, now you're being ridiculous.
- No.

14:26.203 --> 14:28.569
What I'm being is committed
to this relationship.

14:28.739 --> 14:29.967
Really? You're committed?

14:30.140 --> 14:32.506
Yes, and I've jumped through hoops
to prove it.

14:32.676 --> 14:35.907
- What hoops? Dancing lessons?
- No, not dancing lessons.

14:37.147 --> 14:39.115
Yeah, okay, dancing lessons.

14:39.316 --> 14:40.442
And meeting your mom.

14:40.618 --> 14:43.746
And being nice to your friends,
even the ones that don't like me.

14:43.921 --> 14:46.116
And letting you put
these pillows on my bed.

14:46.323 --> 14:48.188
- Did I complain about that?
- Constantly.

14:48.359 --> 14:50.589
And yet here they are.

14:51.362 --> 14:54.889
With your frilly curtains
and your girly lamps.

14:55.065 --> 14:57.693
&lt;i>It's like living inside
the I Dream of Jeannie bottle.&lt;/i>

14:58.335 --> 15:01.236
I'm supposed to be grateful because
you've behaved the way...

15:01.405 --> 15:04.306
...a fiancé is supposed to behave
towards the woman he loves?

15:04.475 --> 15:08.639
Oh, yeah, okay, I see.
Now you're gonna turn it around on me.

15:08.846 --> 15:10.143
Make me the bad guy.

15:10.314 --> 15:13.112
- Where are you going?
- I'm sleeping on the couch.

15:13.284 --> 15:14.410
In my house.

15:14.585 --> 15:18.749
Which you know I own because
I bragged about it the first night we met.

15:23.794 --> 15:26.024
- Alan.
- What? What's wrong?

15:26.797 --> 15:28.059
Chelsea and I had a fight.

15:28.232 --> 15:30.200
I'm sorry. You wanna talk about it?

15:30.367 --> 15:32.835
I just did. Now go sleep on the couch.

15:33.504 --> 15:36.302
If you had the fight,
why do I have to sleep on the couch?

15:36.473 --> 15:39.601
You ever hear of crap rolling uphill?

15:40.010 --> 15:41.204
Get out.

15:41.378 --> 15:44.506
Just using the word "please"
would go such a long way with me.

15:44.682 --> 15:49.585
Fair enough. Please get out before
I pull your pajama bottoms up so far...

15:49.753 --> 15:52.654
...you'll be wearing your balls
as a bolo tie.

15:54.525 --> 15:56.083
There, was that so hard?

16:18.782 --> 16:21.615
I'm sorry for keeping a secret
from you.

16:36.433 --> 16:39.425
Is there any way I can make it up
to you?

16:41.438 --> 16:43.201
Okay, I would be remiss...

16:46.644 --> 16:48.236
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

16:48.412 --> 16:51.074
- You let me lay naked on you.
- I didn't know it was you.

16:51.248 --> 16:54.046
I thought it was a dream.
I didn't know what to say.

16:54.218 --> 16:55.549
And you're so soft and so warm...

16:57.454 --> 16:59.820
Oh, I deserved that.

17:01.692 --> 17:04.820
- What the hell is going on in here?
- Your brother's a pervert!

17:04.995 --> 17:06.895
You woke me up to tell me that?

17:07.665 --> 17:10.099
I came down here to apologize
for keeping a secret.

17:10.267 --> 17:12.394
It was dark,
and I thought it was you...

17:12.569 --> 17:15.436
...so I laid down naked on him
and he let me.

17:15.606 --> 17:18.939
You let Chelsea lie... Wait a minute.
You came down to apologize?

17:19.543 --> 17:21.010
Yes.

17:21.178 --> 17:23.669
So you're saying I'm right
and you're wrong?

17:24.214 --> 17:25.238
Yes. You're right.

17:25.749 --> 17:28.013
Excuse me, I didn't quite get that.

17:28.185 --> 17:31.018
Do you wanna gloat or do you wanna
let me make it up to you?

17:31.188 --> 17:32.780
Make up. I choose make up.

17:33.290 --> 17:36.054
- Then come on.
- Right behind you.

17:36.360 --> 17:37.452
You sick freak.

17:45.235 --> 17:46.361
Still worth it.

17:56.513 --> 18:00.677
Eventually,
Alan's bed-wetting stopped.

18:00.851 --> 18:04.878
At least I hope it did
for the sake of the honeymoon.

18:05.823 --> 18:08.849
Unless, of course,
you're into that kind of thing.

18:12.362 --> 18:14.489
To Alan and Judith.

18:14.665 --> 18:16.633
Yeah.
Yeah.

18:18.769 --> 18:23.229
And now I'd like
to introduce the best man...

18:23.407 --> 18:27.434
...although I consider him
to be a bitter disappointment...

18:27.611 --> 18:30.705
...Alan's brother, Charlie.

18:30.881 --> 18:32.712
Charlie?

18:34.218 --> 18:35.617
Charlie?

18:35.786 --> 18:37.879
Charles.

18:38.355 --> 18:40.118
Coming.

18:47.197 --> 18:49.062
What's going on?

18:49.233 --> 18:53.397
You're making a toast
to your brother and his bride.

18:53.570 --> 18:55.504
How am I doing?

18:56.573 --> 18:58.097
Make the toast.

18:58.275 --> 18:59.867
Okay.

19:01.078 --> 19:04.479
Can I throw in a word
about the bride's sister?

19:04.648 --> 19:07.708
