- Got it.

19:07.951 --> 19:12.945
Well, just FYI,
that word would've been "nasty."

19:15.092 --> 19:19.961
Don't look at me like that, Judy.
Your sister's a freak.

19:20.130 --> 19:22.655
&lt;i>She's a super freak, super freak&lt;/i>

19:22.833 --> 19:26.132
&lt;i>She's super freaky
Super freak, super freak&lt;/i>

19:26.303 --> 19:28.965
Unbelievable.
